# Title: Modify Group Policy Settings
# ID: ada4b0c4-758b-46ac-9033-9004613a150d
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-08-19
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1484.001
# Description: Detect malicious GPO modifications can be used to implement many other malicious behaviors.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*GroupPolicyRefreshTimeDC* OR process.command_line:*GroupPolicyRefreshTimeOffsetDC* OR process.command_line:*GroupPolicyRefreshTime* OR process.command_line:*GroupPolicyRefreshTimeOffset* OR process.command_line:*EnableSmartScreen* OR process.command_line:*ShellSmartScreenLevel*)) AND (process.command_line:*\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\System*) AND ((process.executable:*\\reg.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"reg.exe")))
